WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:08.390
The ancient tradition of Xmas began in the
year 2801, when the Friendly Robot Company

00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:14.360
developed a high-powered mechanical Santa
capable of delivering over five mega presents

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:15.350
per second.

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:22.180
Hey.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:27.580
They tricked him out with a pair of carbon fiber tams and a chrome naughty-nice sensor.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:32.260
So he'd know who deserved gifts and who
deserved brutal punishment.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.290
Yo, that might have been the first mistake
right there.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:41.440
But on Santa's very first delivery, something
went tragically mashugana.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.140
His naughty-nice sensor malfunctioned.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.000
Man, that's some bleeped up-

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.680
Yay! Santa is here!

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.700
Oh. Thank you.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.880
I'm sorry, kids.

00:01:00.890 --> 00:01:04.040
I never wanted you to know Santa was real.

